    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a first-person shooter. You will be tasked with eliminating a monster named Manyfang. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the location you are heading to is a scary place with a suffocating atmosphere, creating a sense of pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the map, there will be a pointing hand indicating the direction where Manyfang is located. The player must go to the direction pointed by the hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497230/extras/48ecd9ff14b427665564d3e80a98a185.avif?t=1751699300\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they travel, the longer the time passes, the more zombies will attack the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497230/extras/7e1881c018e665ed87f31e07eb5d9427.avif?t=1751699300\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eliminating a monster named Manyfang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497230/extras/ad572a892b6601b9ac69e90e71bb84cd.avif?t=1751699300\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game may contain content that is not suitable for all ages or may not be appropriate for viewing in a workplace: frequent violence or bloodshed, general adult content.</p>",
